summary:
Three community projects joined the directory: a model comparison tool, an image-making word game, and a prompt-enhanced image generator.

@dseeker’s model comparison tool was added to the README and website. It lets people test multiple language models in real time with configurable timeouts.

@Dimaq21’s One Word Telegram bot joined the Social Bots list. Players try to write the same word simultaneously, then the bot generates images from their game words.

Zelos AI was added to the community project listings. The Websim project uses Pollinations to enhance prompts and generate images.
